<title>ITALY: Italy Nov cumulative PSBR 135.3 trillion lire.</title>
<headline>Italy Nov cumulative PSBR 135.3 trillion lire.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's cumulative public sector borrowing requirement was 135.3 trillion lire at end-November 1996 about one trillion lire less than during the same period last year, the Treasury Ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>It added that Treasury management operations showed a provisional net defict of around 19 trillion lire last month compared with 19.5 trillion lire in November 1995.</p>
<p>--Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
